  "description": "Welcome to Sand Seeker, an exploration adventure set in an ancient desert city on the edge of the pyramids.\n\nRoam sunlit streets, sandstone buildings, hidden alleys, and open desert paths as the great pyramids loom in the distance. Search for lost locations scattered throughout the city and surrounding sands. Every corner tells a story shaped by time, sand, and history.\n\nSand Seeker focuses on atmospheric exploration — no rush, no pressure — just discovery in a timeless desert world.\n\nFeatures:\n\n>Ancient Egyptian-inspired city environment\n\n>Search-and-find exploration gameplay\n\n>Hidden secrets to uncover\n\n>Immersive desert atmosphere",
